Portions of this software are derived from an earlier MIT-licensed prototype
co-written by the author and a collaborator. This repository (v2) is a new,
substantially reworked project maintained by Dhamodaran Selvam. The prototype
code as imported is preserved in the git tag `v1-baseline`.

Filing data comes from the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission's EDGAR
system (public records). This project is a research tool and does not provide
investment advice.
